      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I think a better solution for this would be to just blacklist any vrchat or unity textures and variables, and silently drop the call",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
    {
      "__v": 0,
      "_id": "62fc59066b0fa644a160c13c",
      "author": {
        "_id": "5a3c5fa04a8da67427803b3e",
        "alias": "Ochre Kite",
        "aliasID": "65c2b4b2ed6eefce4ce2bba1",
        "anonymized": false,
        "avatarURL": "https://canny.io/images/07448897ea867c9a94ea5a3ec82d022b.png",
        "created": "2017-12-22T01:28:00.657Z",
        "name": "Xiexe",
        "serviceAccount": false,
        "urlName": null
      },
      "authorID": null,
      "boardID": "58c62efae9868f3662e9d9a1",
      "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
      "created": "2022-08-17T02:57:10.267Z",
      "deleted": false,
      "fileURLs": [],
      "files": [],
      "imageURLs": [],
      "integrationSourceType": null,
      "internal": false,
      "itemSourceType": null,
      "mentionedUserIDs": null,
      "mentionedUsers": [],
      "mergeID": null,
      "parentID": null,
      "pinned": false,
      "postDeleted": false,
      "postID": "62f7f0c84b46a659b5c21f78",
      "private": false,
      "reactions": {
        "like": 2
      },
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "As far as I'd know, we'd like to keep the _Udon prefix as it means that we aren't forcing ourselves into a naming paradigm where we now might need to go change a bunch of stuff that we've written in the past, or to prevent overriding things set by something like Post Processing.\nHowever, I think in the case of audiolink, being a really large part of VRC at this point, it's reasonable to add it as an exception, and, in fact, I did think of that when I doing this.\nKeep in mind, this is all my personal opinion, but it's something I want to do, and will most likely be agreed upon.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
    {
      "__v": 0,
      "_id": "62fc5c2c2714df44abbd8a6b",
      "author": {
        "_id": "5adf7c5544b24b6ef7cb0f25",
        "alias": "Giant Beetle",
        "aliasID": "65c27d10ed6eefce4cc8cf29",
        "anonymized": false,
        "avatarURL": "https://canny-assets.io/images/5dfdb10bcb166bc4094d2012d0771577.png",
        "created": "2018-04-24T18:49:57.778Z",
        "name": "Synergiance",
        "serviceAccount": false,
        "urlName": null
      },
      "authorID": null,
      "boardID": "58c62efae9868f3662e9d9a1",
      "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
      "created": "2022-08-17T03:10:36.327Z",
      "deleted": false,
      "fileURLs": [],
      "files": [],
      "imageURLs": [],
      "integrationSourceType": null,
      "internal": false,
      "itemSourceType": null,
      "mentionedUserIDs": null,
      "mentionedUsers": [],
      "mergeID": null,
      "parentID": "62fc59066b0fa644a160c13c",
      "pinned": false,
      "postDeleted": false,
      "postID": "62f7f0c84b46a659b5c21f78",
      "private": false,
      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "If the _Udon prefix is to stay, I'd like it to be that any calls to set material properties that already have the _Udon prefix applied not be modified, in order to keep the shader and the udon consistent.\nOn another point there are other legacy textures and properties that people may want to access via Udon.  I will point to my comment below this one.  This isn't a perfect solution either, but in such a sense there is no perfect solution anyways, and it wouldn't restrict world creators or the VRC developers.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
