  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "VRCShader.SetGlobalTexture was recently exposed to Udon, and we'd like to make use of it for AudioLink (https://github.com/llealloo/vrc-udon-audio-link), as it would let us get rid of a pesky GrabPass.\nThe method is only usable to set textures named with an '_Udon' prefix. This means that we cannot make use of the method without causing a breaking change. We'd probably have to keep the GrabPass around for quite a while in a deprecation period.\nIf we could instead directly set the global texture expected by current AudioLink compatible shaders, i.e '_AudioTexture', we could completely avoid this.\nPlease either don't force the _Udon prefix on exported texture names, or make an exception for _AudioTexture.",
  "error": null,
